  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "《山海經》的神話世界",
    "sub_ename": "THE MYTHICAL WORLD OF \"THE CLASSIC OF MOUNTAINS AND SEAS\"",
    "describe_ch": "《山海經》是經典嗎？為何書中存在著許多荒誕不經的神話內容，但依然流傳至今呢？「除魅」後的現代人，為何還需要神話？本課程旨在帶領學生認識《山海經》中的山川、地理、神靈、異獸、巫術等，希望透過神話故事的介紹，讓學生進一步了解中國古代的宇宙觀與原始信仰、宗教儀式之間的關係，並透過東、西方神話的比較，以及現實生活情境的連結，重新活化神話的當代性價值，同時促進學生對古代文獻的深度理解與應用能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Is the book The Classic of Mountains and Seas classic? Why are there so many absurd mythological contents in the book that are still passed down to this day? Why do modern people still need myths after being de-enchanted? This course aims to lead students to understand the mountains, rivers, geography, gods, strange beasts, witchcraft, etc. in the book The Classic of Mountains and Seas. It is expected that through the introduction of mythological stories, students can further understand the relationship between ancient Chinese cosmology and primitive beliefs and religious rituals. Through the comparison of Eastern and Western myths and the connection of real life situations, the contemporary value of myths will be revitalized to promote students' in-depth understanding and application ability of ancient documents.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
